  "bestiary": {
    "lore": "What the old square worships: a god of the lost districts, made of the faces it took.",
    "weakness": "Holy. Every villager who stands costs a Sanity more on each of its hits: thin the faithful first. Sanity-proof Scions are worth their weight here.",
